         "## Results",
         "The average time to fix a reported pothole fell from 11 days to 5 in the first monsoon after the map launched, the corporation said.",
         "Civic groups welcomed the transparency but said repairs were often patchy and failed again within weeks. They want the map to show how long each repair lasts, not just how quickly it is done. Other Maharashtra cities, including Nagpur and Nashik, have asked for the software.",
